visits	Physician office visits
nvisits	Non-physician office visits
ovisits	Physician hospital outpatient visits
novisits	Non-physician hospital outpatient visits
emergency	Emergency room visits
hospital	Hospital stays
health	Self-perceived health (poor/average/excellent)
chronic	Number of chronic conditions
adl	Activities of daily living (limited/normal)
region	Census region of residence
age	Age in years (divided by 10)
afam	African-American (yes/no)
gender	Gender
married	Married (yes/no)
school	Years of education
income	Family income ($10,000s)
employed	Employed (yes/no)
insurance	Covered by private insurance (yes/no)
medicaid	Covered by Medicaid (yes/no)
